"900BU", 5.33, 1.50,"R",13.78,"Applicable in Alabama:"
"900MU", 5.33,15.28,"R",63.22,"  Any person who knowingly presents a false or fraudulent claim for payment of a loss or benefit or who knowingly"
"900MU", 6.20, 1.50,"R",77.00,"presents false information in an application for insurance is guilty of a crime and may be subject to restitution, fines, or confinement in"
"900MU", 7.05, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"prison, or any combination thereof."
"900BU", 8.51, 1.50,"R",13.11,"Applicable in Alaska:"
"900MU", 8.51,14.61,"R",63.89,"  A person who knowingly and with intent to injure, defraud, or deceive an insurance company files a claim"
"900MU", 9.38, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"containing false, incomplete, or misleading information may be prosecuted under state law."
"900BU",11.01, 1.50,"R",13.62,"Applicable in Arizona:"
"900MU",11.01,15.12,"R",62.88,"  For your protection Arizona law requires the following statement to appear on this form. Any person who"
"900MU",11.88, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"knowingly presents a false or fraudulent claim for payment of a loss is subject to criminal and civil penalties."
"900BU",13.51, 1.50,"R",14.40,"Applicable in Arkansas:"
"900MU",13.51,15.90,"R",62.60,"  Any person who knowingly presents a false or fraudulent claim for payment of a loss or benefit or knowingly"
"900MU",14.38, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"presents false information in an application for insurance is guilty of a crime and may be subject to fines and confinement in prison."
"900BU",15.83, 1.50,"R",14.60,"Applicable in California:"
"900MU",15.83,16.10,"R",62.40,"  For your protection California law requires the following to appear on this form.  Any person who knowingly"
"900MU",16.70, 1.50,"R",77.00,"presents false or fraudulent claim for the payment of a loss is guilty of a crime and may be subject to fines and confinement in state"
"900MU",17.55, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"prison."
"900BU",18.81, 1.50,"R",14.06,"Applicable in Colorado:"
"900MU",18.81,15.56,"R",62.94,"  It is unlawful to knowingly provide false, incomplete, or misleading facts or information to an insurance company"
"900MU",19.68, 1.50,"R",77.00,"for the purpose of defrauding or attempting to defraud the company. Penalties may include imprisonment, fines, denial of insurance and"
"900MU",20.53, 1.50,"R",77.00,"civil damages.  Any insurance company or agent of an insurance company who knowingly provides false, incomplete, or misleading facts"
"900MU",21.38, 1.50,"R",77.00,"or information to a policyholder or claimant for the purpose of defrauding or attempting to defraud the policyholder or claimant with regard"
"900MU",22.23, 1.50,"R",77.00,"to a settlement or award payable from insurance proceeds shall be reported to the Colorado Division of Insurance within the Department"
"900MU",23.08, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"of Regulatory Agencies."
"900BU",24.51, 1.50,"R",14.22,"Applicable in Delaware:"
"900MU",24.51,15.72,"R",62.78,"  Any person who knowingly, and with intent to injure, defraud or deceive any insurer, files a statement of claim"
"900MU",25.38, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"containing any false, incomplete or misleading information is guilty of a felony."
"900BU",26.83, 1.50,"R",22.89,"Applicable in the District of Columbia:"
"900MU",26.83,24.39,"R",54.11,"  WARNING: It is a crime to provide false or misleading information to an insurer for the purpose"
"900MU",27.70, 1.50,"R",77.00,"of defrauding the insurer or any other person.  Penalties include imprisonment and/or fines. In addition, an insurer may deny insurance"
"900MU",28.55, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"benefits if false information materially related to a claim was provided by the applicant."
"900BU",30.01, 1.50,"R",13.02,"Applicable in Florida:"
"900MU",30.01,14.52,"R",63.98,"  Any person who knowingly and with intent to injure, defraud, or deceive any insurer files a statement of claim"
"900MU",30.88, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"containing any false, incomplete, or misleading information is guilty of a felony of the third degree."
"900BU",32.51, 1.50,"R",12.41,"Applicable in Idaho:"
"900MU",32.51,13.91,"R",64.59,"  Any person who knowingly, and with intent to defraud or deceive any insurance company, files a statement"
"900MU",33.38, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"containing any false, incomplete or misleading information is guilty of a felony."
"900BU",35.01, 1.50,"R",13.25,"Applicable in Indiana:"
"900MU",35.01,14.75,"R",63.75,"  A person who knowingly and with intent to defraud an insurer files a statement of claim containing any false,"
"900MU",35.88, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"incomplete, or misleading information commits a felony."
"900BU",37.38, 1.50,"R",13.51,"Applicable in Kansas:"
"900MU",37.38,15.01,"R",63.49,"  Any person who, knowingly and with intent to defraud, presents, causes to be presented or prepares with"
"900MU",38.25, 1.50,"R",77.00,"knowledge or belief that it will be presented to or by an insurer, purported insurer, broker or any agent thereof, any written, electronic,"
"900MU",39.10, 1.50,"R",77.00,"electronic impulse, facsimile, magnetic, oral, or telephonic communication or statement as part of, or in support of, an application for the"
"900MU",39.95, 1.50,"R",77.00,"issuance of, or the rating of an insurance policy for personal or commercial insurance, or a claim for payment or other benefit pursuant to"
"900MU",40.80, 1.50,"R",77.00,"an insurance policy for commercial or personal insurance which such person knows to contain materially false information concerning any"
"900MU",41.65, 1.50,"R",77.00,"fact material thereto; or conceals, for the purpose of misleading, information concerning any fact material thereto commits a fraudulent"
"900MU",42.50, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"insurance act."
"900BU",43.83, 1.50,"R",14.21,"Applicable in Kentucky:"
"900MU",43.83,15.71,"R",62.79,"  Any person who knowingly and with intent to defraud any insurance company or other person files a statement"
"900MU",44.70, 1.50,"R",77.00,"of claim containing any materially false information or conceals, for the purpose of misleading, information concerning any fact material"
"900MU",45.55, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"thereto commits a fraudulent insurance act, which is a crime."
"900BU",47.01, 1.50,"R",14.61,"Applicable in Louisiana:"
"900MU",47.01,16.11,"R",62.39,"  Any person who knowingly presents a false or fraudulent claim for payment of a loss or benefit or knowingly"
"900MU",47.88, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"presents false information in an application for insurance is guilty of a crime and may be subject to fines and confinement in prison."
"900BU",49.51, 1.50,"R",12.44,"Applicable in Maine:"
"900MU",49.51,13.94,"R",64.56,"  It is a crime to knowingly provide false, incomplete or misleading information to an insurance company for the"
"900MU",50.38, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"purpose of defrauding the company.  Penalties may include imprisonment, fines or denial of insurance benefits."
"900BU",52.08, 1.50,"R",14.23,"Applicable in Maryland:"
"900MU",52.08,15.73,"R",62.77,"  Any person who knowingly or willfully presents a false or fraudulent claim for payment of a loss or benefit or"
"900MU",52.95, 1.50,"R",77.00,"who knowingly or willfully presents false information in an application for insurance is guilty of a crime and may be subject to fines and"
"900MU",53.80, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"confinement in prison."
"900BU",55.26, 1.50,"R",14.23,"Applicable in Michigan:"
"900MU",55.26,15.73,"R",62.77,"  Any person who knowingly presents a false or fraudulent claim for payment of a loss or benefit or knowingly"
"900MU",56.13, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"presents false information in an application for insurance is guilty of a crime and may be subject to fines and confinement in prison."
"900BU",57.43, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"Applicable in Minnesota:"
"900MU",57.43,16.27,"L", 0.00,"  A person who files a claim with intent to defraud or helps commit a fraud against an insurer is guilty of a crime."
"900BU",59.01, 1.50,"R",13.18,"Applicable in Nevada:"
"900MU",59.01,14.68,"R",63.82,"  Pursuant to NRS 686A.291, any person who knowingly and willfully files a statement of claim that contains any"
"900MU",59.88, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"false, incomplete or misleading information concerning a material fact is guilty of a category D felony."
"900BU",61.08, 1.50,"R",18.05,"Applicable in New Hampshire:"
"900MU",61.08,19.55,"R",58.45,"  Any person who, with a purpose to injure, defraud or deceive any insurance company, files a statement"
"900MU",61.95, 1.50,"R",76.50,"of claim containing any false, incomplete or misleading information is subject to prosecution and punishment for insurance fraud as"
"900MU",62.80, 1.50,"L", 0.00,"provided in RSA 638:20."

